apt-url (1.1.0.1) stable; urgency=low

    * Add new option --onlyUrl
      - Returns only the package URL of its download location
    * Add new option --onlyFile
      - Returns only the filename for the package
    * Add new option --onlyApt
      - Package information is retrieved from apt-get instead 
        of apt-move / apt-fetc
    * Add new option --pretty
      - Formats text with colors and columns
        instead of apt-move
    * Add new option --package
      - Allows you to specify a package one of two ways
        apt-url --package packagename
        apt-url packagename
    * Refactor option --help
      - Displays each command and a description
      - Command usage examples added
 
 -- Aetherinox <aetherinox@proton.me>  Sat, 21 Oct 2023 00:00:00 +0000

